    branchId: 'math-foundations',
    level: 'Undergraduate 1',
    summary: 'The field \u211c extends the reals with i² = −1, turning algebra into geometry: every complex number is a scaling and a rotation, which is why waves, oscillations and quantum amplitudes speak this language.',
