    id: 'differential-equations',
    title: 'Differential Equations',
    branchId: 'calculus',
    level: 'Undergraduate 2',
    summary: 'Differential equations encode how a quantity changes. Linear equations admit superposition and a complete solution space of dimension equal to their order; nonlinear ones harbour chaos, solitons and most of the interesting physics.',
